  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag1168" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1. General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are a Delaware Limited Liability Company (LLC), originally organized as a corporation in 1930 and converted to an LLC on February 15, 2008. When we refer to "us," "we," "our," "the Company," or &amp;#8220;Natural&amp;#8221; we are describing Natural Gas Pipeline Company of America LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of NGPL Holdings LLC (NGPL Holdings)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;. Funds managed by ArcLight Capital Partners, LLC and Kinder Morgan, Inc. (KMI) hold a 62.5% and 37.5% interest, respectively, in NGPL Holdings. KMI operates our assets pursuant to a 15-year amended Operations and Reimbursement Agreement with a primary term that expires in June 2038, and includes 5-year term extension rights.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have prepared our accompanying financial statements in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America. In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through May 28, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2. Risk Management&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Certain of our business activities expose us to risks associated with unfavorable changes in the market price of natural gas. Pursuant to our management&amp;#8217;s approved risk management policy, we use derivative contracts to hedge or reduce our exposure to this risk.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Energy Commodity Price Risk Management&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026, we had the following outstanding commodity forward contracts to hedge our forecasted energy commodity purchases and sales:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="border: 1pt solid #000000; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

&lt;tr style="height: 25.2pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 514.7pt; border-right: 1pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 4.5pt solid #000000; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 2.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Derivatives not designated as hedging contracts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 374.2pt; border-bottom: 4.5pt solid #000000; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Net open position long/(short)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 25.2pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 514.7pt; border-right: 1pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 2.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Natural gas fixed price&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 374.2pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 5.4pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: right; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(8.7) billion cubic feet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 25.2pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 514.7pt; border-right: 1pt solid #000000; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 2.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Natural gas basis&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 374.2pt; padding-right: 2.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 5.4pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: right; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(3.2) billion cubic feet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;

&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026, the maximum length of time over which we have hedged, for economic purposes, our exposure to the variability in future cash flows associated with energy commodity price risk is through December 2027.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The following table summarizes the fair values of our energy commodity derivative contracts, which measurements were based on Level 1 and Level 2 inputs, and are included in our balance sheet (in millions):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 905.05pt; margin-right: 9pt; margin-left: 9pt; border: 1pt solid #000000; border-collapse: collapse; float: left;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

