&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;In conjunction with certain derivative contracts, we are required to provide collateral to and receive collateral from our counterparties through restricted cash deposits placed in margin accounts. As of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, we had cash margin deposits of zero and $1 million, respectively, posted with our counterparties and recorded in Account 134 &amp;#8220;Other Special Deposits&amp;#8221; on our balance sheets.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
