&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;During the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, we made distributions totaling $109 million and $87 million, respectively, to our Members.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
